    SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
    TEST-ONLY stub of Jupiter's _assets/master.html.tt for off-server
    static renders (tests/render_check.pl). NEVER installed: the real master
    template ships with cPanel. It emulates just enough of the documented
    WRAPPER contract (page_title, page_stylesheets, page_scripts, content). %]
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>[% page_title %]</title>
[% FOREACH css IN page_stylesheets %]<link rel="stylesheet" href="[% css %]">
[% END %]
[% FOREACH js IN page_scripts %]<script src="[% js %]"></script>
[% END %]
</head>
<body>
[% content %]
</body>
</html>
